      "content": "Here is a draft focusing on nuanced assessment rather than forced certainty. The intelligence suggests APT-44 exhibits increased reconnaissance activity near our hubs, indicating a heightened interest in the target environment. However, definitive indicators pointing toward a coordinated strike within the next 72 hours remain ambiguous, leaning toward preparatory actions. I recommend flagging this for moderate priority, reflecting heightened vigilance without asserting imminent attack.",
